---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import LightField from '../components/LightField.astro';
import { founders } from '../data/brand';
---
<SiteLayout path="/about" title="About — Dawnlight Labs" description="An independent research laboratory in India. Meet the people and thinking behind Dawnlight.">
<section class="shell page-opening about-opening"><p class="context">About Dawnlight</p><h1>People on both sides<br/>of the technology.</h1><div class="opening-bottom"><p>We are an independent research laboratory in India, exploring intelligence, computing, and emerging hardware. We also build software to put ideas into use and understand their real constraints.</p><p class="about-aside">Research asks what is possible.<br/>Design asks who it is for.</p></div><LightField/></section>
<section class="about-thinking"><div class="shell practice-grid"><h2>The user matters.<br/>So do the details.</h2><div><p>Efficiency is not just a benchmark. It is also someone's battery, the hardware they can afford, and the time they spend waiting.</p><p>Control is not just a setting. It is being able to understand a proposed action and decide whether it should happen.</p><p>These connections between engineering and everyday use are where we want to work. Our ambition is to explore original approaches, and be clear about what the evidence supports.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="shell people-section" aria-labelledby="people-title"><div class="people-intro"><p class="context">The founders</p><h2 id="people-title">A small team.<br/>A shared curiosity.</h2></div><div class="founder-grid">{founders.map(founder=><article class="founder"><h3>{founder.name}</h3><p class="founder-title">{founder.title}</p><p>{founder.focus}.</p><div class="founder-links"><a href={'mailto:'+founder.email}>Email</a><a href={founder.github} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">GitHub</a><a href={founder.linkedin} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a></div></article>)}</div></section>
<section class="shell small-outro"><h2>See how that<br/>takes shape.</h2><div><p>Four projects explore different parts of the relationship between people and computers.</p><a class="plain-link" href="/projects">Meet the projects</a></div></section>
</SiteLayout>